Plan: Workspace Auto-Provisioning (Option C)
TL;DR: When an employee is invited in the onboarding wizard, NeureCore captures their workspace provisioning intent (email pattern, folder structure, provider) inline in the Integrations step — no OAuth redirect during wizard. After the wizard, a dashboard banner prompts the admin to connect their Google Workspace or Microsoft 365 admin account in Settings → Workspace. Once connected, the backend provisions corporate email addresses and cloud folders for all pending invited users.

