Decisions
No mid-wizard OAuth redirect — intent only captured in wizard; auth happens post-login in Settings
Actual Google/M365 API calls are stubs with // TODO comments — wired up once OAuth credentials are configured in env; the module structure is ready to fill in
Token storage: OAuth tokens stored in DB as plaintext for now (oauthAccessToken, oauthRefreshToken columns). Production hardening = encrypt with AES-256-GCM using a ENCRYPTION_KEY env var — excluded from this scope
Email provisioning only triggered for invited users (from wizardData.invitations) — future employees added via the team management page will be handled separately
Workspace panel only shown in IntegrationsStep when STORAGE_GOOGLE_DRIVE or STORAGE_ONEDRIVE is toggled — the two storage options are the natural trigger for corporate workspace setup
Excluded: actual sending of welcome emails with credentials (stub returns credentials, email sending is a TODO inside the provider)
